WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.202
Hi! In editing, you are the teacher. You find the wrong words in a passage and write the correct ones. There are two kinds of mistakes: spelling and grammar. Let's learn how to spot them.

2
00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:20.226
Some words are often misspelt. Friend has i before e, and so does believe.

3
00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:27.930
Adding -ing or -ed has rules. Hope drops the e: hoping. Stop doubles the p: stopped.

4
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:35.634
When a word ends in a consonant and y, change y to i: carry becomes carried, baby becomes babies.

5
00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:44.562
In Singapore we use British spelling: favourite and colour have a u. Tomorrow has one m and two r's.

6
00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:49.890
Subject-verb agreement: after she, he or it, use has.

7
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.018
Tense: with yesterday, use the past tense, went.

8
00:00:54.168 --> 00:00:59.682
Singular and plural: after two we need a plural, so box becomes boxes.

9
00:00:59.832 --> 00:01:06.426
Pronouns: as the subject we need I, and it's polite to put yourself last.

10
00:01:06.576 --> 00:01:11.682
Watch out! Only change the underlined word, not anything else!

11
00:01:11.832 --> 00:01:16.746
For each underlined word, write one correct word in the box beside it.

12
00:01:16.896 --> 00:01:23.514
Before you decide, read the whole sentence and look at the time words and the subject.

13
00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:35.370
Your turn! My best freind lives next door. Freind is misspelt. What is the correct spelling? Pause and think.

14
00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:42.810
F, r, i, e, n, d. Friend, with i before e. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:52.650
Another one! The bus stoped at the corner. How do we fix stoped? Pause and think.

16
00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:59.682
Stopped. We double the p before adding e-d. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:59.832 --> 00:02:10.050
Next one! Last week, my aunt bring us some cakes. How do we fix bring? Pause and think.

18
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:18.114
Brought. Last week is in the past, and the past tense of bring is brought. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:18.264 --> 00:02:27.474
One more! Tom and me went to the zoo. How do we fix me? Pause and think.

20
00:02:27.624 --> 00:02:38.154
I. Tom and I is the subject, and the subject needs I, not me. Try it without Tom: I went to the zoo. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:38.304 --> 00:02:48.042
Last one! There are three baby in the room. How do we fix baby? Pause and think.

22
00:02:48.192 --> 00:02:56.514
Babies. After three we need a plural, so change y to i and add e-s. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:56.664 --> 00:03:04.194
Remember the spelling rules: drop the e, double the letter, change y to i, and learn the tricky words.

24
00:03:04.344 --> 00:03:10.674
For grammar, check the subject, the time words and the number, and only change the underlined word.

25
00:03:10.824 --> 00:03:16.194
Today, take out a composition you wrote and be the teacher!

